@startuml 核心数据关系图
' 胡豪 · 第二阶段分析 · 概念层数据关系
' 只固定实体间关系与约束；业务字段以各主责人分析为准
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #F5F8FB
  BorderColor #6F97B8
  FontColor #1F2A37
}
hide empty members

class User <<用户>> 
class AuthSession <<会话>>
class StudyTask <<自习任务>>
class LocationSample <<位置样本>>
class Spawn <<遭遇机会>>
class Challenge <<问答挑战>>
class Question <<题目>>
class AnswerAttempt <<答题请求>>
class CaptureRecord <<捕获记录>>
class Species <<精灵种类>>

User "1" -- "0..*" AuthSession : 签发/撤销不删历史
User "1" -- "0..*" StudyTask : 任务归属用户
User "1" -- "0..*" Spawn : 遭遇归属用户
User "1" -- "0..*" CaptureRecord : 收录归属用户
StudyTask "1" -- "0..*" LocationSample : 样本必属本人任务
StudyTask "1" -- "0..1" Spawn : 驻留达标最多产生一次
Spawn "1" -- "0..1" Challenge : 一次遭遇最多一个进行中挑战
Spawn "0..*" -- "1" Species
Challenge "0..*" -- "1" Question
Challenge "1" -- "0..*" AnswerAttempt : requestId 幂等键
Challenge "1" -- "0..1" CaptureRecord : 答对结算产生
CaptureRecord "0..*" -- "1" Species
Species "1" -- "0..*" Question : 按种类组织

note bottom of CaptureRecord
  唯一约束 (userId, spawnId)：
  同一遭遇重复提交不重复发奖
end note

note bottom of Question
  正确答案仅服务端判题可见，
  不下发客户端
end note

note right of StudyTask
  StudyTask / LocationSample
  字段待董欣毓、赵冠钧定稿，
  本图只固定关系
end note
@enduml
